  "sourceTitle": "Fettucini Alfredo With Shrimp",
  "sourceText": "Fettucini Alfredo With Shrimp\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, January 4, 2010 - 1:05am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup heavy cream\n3 tablespoons butter\n2/3 cup parmesan cheese, fine\n1 pound cooked fettucini\n6 dashes of pepper\nDash of nutmeg\n1 pound shrimp\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook fettucini, keep warm. Add all other ingredients to large fry pan. Keep stirring until thickened. Boil shrimp in water for about 5 minutes. Add fettucini and shrimp to sauce.",
